column6:
Depends exactly on what you mean by iterative and recursive functions.<p>Summing a list could be done by:<p>sum_iterative( list ) {
    sum = 0
    for( element in list ) {
        sum += element
    }
    return sum
}<p>or<p>sum_recursive( list ) {
    if( list.empty ) { return 0 } else {
        return list.head + sum_recursive( list.tail )
    }
}<p>So saying everything that can be done iteratively can't be done recursively is false, and also vice versa.
